creatures:
- name: Magma Mephit
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 11  
      **Hit Points** 18 (rollable(dice=4d6 + 4,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Fly 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Initiative) (11)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=8)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=7)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-2,label=-2,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Vulnerabilities** cold  
      **Damage Immunities** fire, poison  
      **Condition Immunities** exhaustion, poisoned  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 10  
      **Languages** Primordial (Ignan, Terran)  
      **Challenge** 1/2 (100 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Death Burst.*** The mephit explodes when it dies. *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 11, each creature in a 5-foot ***Emanation*** originating from the mephit. *Failure:* rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Death Burst]) Fire damage. *Success:* Half damage.

      ## Actions

      ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+1,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Slashing damage plus rollable(dice=1d6,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Fire damage.

      ***Fire Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 6,dicelabel=Recharge [Fire Breath])).*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 11, each creature in a 15-foot ***Cone***. *Failure:* rollable(dice=2d6,dicelabel=Damage [Fire Breath]) Fire damage. *Success:* Half damage.

